# Ravel workspace artifacts — never in git (BUNDLE.md, EXECUTION.md).
#
# ! Anchored with a leading slash, deliberately. Unanchored, `canon/` and
# `sources/` match at ANY depth and would silently exclude the `src/canon/` and
# `src/sources/` packages — a repository missing its own source, with no error.
/sources/
/canon/
/work/
/bundles/
/state/
/registry-local/

*.parquet
*.db
*.sqlite3
